# Dockerfile only clones the repo fresh from GitHub (git clone) - it never
# COPYs the local working tree - but `docker build` still tars up this whole
# directory as build context before even reading the Dockerfile. Ignoring
# the heavy, disposable local artifacts keeps that step fast.
cmake-build-*/
build-ubuntu20-test/
build/
Build/
builder/deps/
coverage/deps/
.git/
.idea/
.vscode/
